{"id":"verantwortung","lemma":"Verantwortung","pos":"noun","rank":1101,"glosses":["responsibility"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈʔantvɔʁtʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5e/De-Verantwortung.ogg/De-Verantwortung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Verantwortung","plural":"Verantwortungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Wer trägt die Verantwortung?","en":"Who's responsible?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392282","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Das ist Ihre Verantwortung.","en":"That's your responsibility.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567005","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Niemand will Verantwortung übernehmen.","en":"Nobody wants to take responsibility.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null,{"g":"to take over"}]},{"text":"Ich habe Verantwortung.","en":"I've got responsibilities.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null]},{"text":"Ich übernehme die Verantwortung.","en":"I'll take responsibility.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to take over","l":"übernehmen"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}